[5.918304, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1mLAYER-BY-LAYER SUMMARY\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mNarrative claim vs what the server actually did\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mLayer 0 — Trust Protocol\u001b[0m\r\n    Open endpoints:              ✓ /claim /proof /governance/tally require no auth (by design)\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mLayer 1 — Identity & Reputation\u001b[0m\r\n    Identities:                  ✓ Alice / Bob / Carol created\r\n    Carol stake:                 ✓ Staked 10,000 credits  VP≈15.40\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mLayer 3 — Agent Trust\u001b[0m\r\n    Registration:                ✓ Agent d7b6e122874b603d  delegation del:did:veritas:e8de5fa9a6a639ec7f8037de154fdacf:d7b6e122874b603d:1784117135.399849\r\n    Cap enforcement:             ✓ Enforced — 150 > 100 credits → 403 (spend_up_to:N_credits parsed)\r\n    Trust before:                50.0 (baseline)\r\n    Trust→resolve chain:✓ trust_score: 50.0 → 40.0 \r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mLayer 4 — Economic Trust\u001b[0m\r\n    Violation (150>100):         ✓ 150-credit TX created (economic route has no cap check)  TX=610b334cc608e8e8\r\n    Escrow funded:               ✓ Escrow c5f27c183cc4b1bb (funded)\r\n    Dispute filed:               ✓ Escrow c5f27c183cc4b1bb → disputed\r\n    Dispute resolved:            ✓ Escrow → resolved  (arbiter: Carol)\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mLayer 5 — Governance\u001b[0m\r\n    Governance cycle:            ✓ Proposal 737631a946d7bf95 executed (arbiter_election)\r\n    Carol arbiter:               ✓ Carol elected — arbiter check will pass\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mVERDICT\u001b[0m\r\n    governance → arbiter election:  WIRED ✓  (execute() adds to gov_engine.arbiters)\r\n    arbiter → escrow resolve:       WIRED ✓  (is_arbiter() check gates resolve endpoint)\r\n    escrow resolve → agent trust:   WIRED ✓  (resolve_dispute() calls agent_registry.file_dispute on loss)\r\n    delegation cap enforcement:     WIRED ✓  (spend_up_to:N_credits parsed on /agents/{id}/transaction)\r\n    note: /economic/transaction has no cap check — separate system boundary\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
